agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/archive-complete-contract/implementation-return.json:31:        "DogfoodArchiveTests.test_recomputed_archive_digest_cannot_accept_case_status_provenance_or_novelty_drift",
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/archive-complete-contract/implementation-return.json:35:        "DogfoodArchiveTests.test_replay_rejects_case_set_and_per_case_promotion_records_after_digest_recompute",
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/archive-complete-contract/implementation-return.json:38:      "details": "All named archive-only case mutations failed after recomputing archive_digest_sha256. Coordinated queue tampering failed against canonical topic state even after deterministic manual ID, linked result/evidence, result digest, archive queue, blocking IDs, and archive digest were updated. Malformed status/novelty and invalid topic enums produced DogfoodArchiveError rather than KeyError or ValueError leakage."
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/archive-complete-contract/implementation-return.json:93:  "residual_boundary": "Archive and topic-state digests plus canonical local replay do not provide an external trust anchor on a fully compromised host that can replace every local fixture, contract, source artifact, state file, and digest. No production/device evidence, external release proof, or independent mathematical proof is established here. The no-claim/no-trace boundary remains enforced.",
