agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-review-lanes/final/returns/A4-manual-linkage-final-review.md:7:  finding: No fail-open `continue`, weak queue-only shortcut, or state-ordering bypass was found. `manual_queue` and `next_cursor` both call `_load_state`; `run()` calls `_load_state` before checking the replayed batch digest. `_load_state` validates the complete manual queue before batches, validates every stored result before adding it to `validated_batches`, and validates the complete cursor chain before returning state.
