agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:6:  "root_cause": "The persisted disposition_evidence held only a one-way input fingerprint and mutable result-linked fields. Because the input fingerprint digest was not a durable canonical projection of the complete input identity, an attacker could replace input A's observation, idempotency key, content digest, risk flags, and result evidence with values from persisted input B, recompute local digests, or introduce a valid manual queue item and make an ordinary input appear to be high-risk manual review. The loader had no independently persisted projection against which to reconstruct the TopicObservationInput identity and disposition.",
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:17:      "envelope_binding": "Each batch stores and validates input_fingerprints, batch_digest_sha256, input_projection_digest_sha256, input_projections, input_observation_ids, disposition_evidence, and result_digest_sha256. The projection digest includes topic, cursor, next_cursor, batch digest, and sorted canonical projections. Every digest and mapping is recomputed and cross-checked on load.",
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:20:        "The recomputed projection fingerprint must equal the persisted input_fingerprints entry and the projection digest must match the batch digest envelope.",
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:21:        "Disposition evidence must match the projection's observation_id, idempotency key, observation content digest, byte digest, byte size, and risk flags; the result observation identity and input_observation_ids must also match.",
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:45:        "TopicObservationTests.test_input_projection_rejects_cross_batch_observation_swap_after_digest_recompute",
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:50:      "details": "The first test imports real A and B in separate batches, rewrites A's stored result, observation linkage, evidence, processed fingerprint, seen key, and local digests to B's values, and requires reload failure. The second test rewrites imported A into MANUAL_REVIEW/HIGH_RISK_EVENT, adds a deterministic self-consistent queue item, optionally forges evidence risk flags, recomputes the result digest, and requires reload failure because the original projection has no risk flags. The third changes a cursor-conflict queue entry to a foreign topic, recomputes its deterministic manual_id, and updates the matching manual event; reload fails closed."
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/input-projection/implementation-return.json:113:  "residual_local_digest_trust_boundary": "The local result, batch, projection, and archive-related digests plus persisted-source readback detect the requested coordinated replay mutations, but a fully compromised host can rewrite every local state input and recompute every local digest. This bounded repair has no external trust anchor and establishes no production/device or remote readback evidence.",
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/state-result-invariant/worker-task.txt:8:Objective: make every durable TopicItemResult disposition independently checkable against persisted, non-result evidence. A recomputed result_digest_sha256 must not permit IMPORTED to become IDEMPOTENT, DUPLICATE, or PENDING. A manual item cannot become IMPORTED with manual_id cleared while leaving an orphan queue entry. Keep the no-claim/no-trace boundary. Provide explicit durable-state migration or a fail-closed versioned recovery contract for the schema change; do not silently strand prior state.
agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/evidence/a4-remediation/state-result-invariant/worker-task.txt:21:Required red tests must mutate persisted state and recompute any local digest, then verify reload/replay fails for: IMPORTED -> each non-import terminal/nonterminal disposition that is not derivable; MANUAL_REVIEW -> IMPORTED with manual_id cleared and aggregate status adjusted; an orphaned manual queue entry. Test whichever migration/recovery policy is implemented.
